[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     8[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ```c
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     9[0m:[38;5;10m[49m void driver(const char *s1, const char *s2);
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    10[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ```
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    11[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m There is no init/teardown, no handle, no context struct, no runtime
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    13[0m:[38;5;10m[49m option/mode/flag setter, no `#ifdef` in the library, and no second (lower-level)
